Big-endian hosts (SPARC): byte-swap the big-endian MOD data only on
little-endian hosts, swap the little-endian WAV/FLAC/IFF fields there,
and open the audio devices as AUDIO_S16SYS (the mixer writes native
int16; AUDIO_S16 is little-endian). No change on little-endian hosts.

Upstream status: declined upstream (https://github.com/8bitbubsy/pt2-clone/pull/53), kept for big-endian hosts (SPARC)

